1 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and October to November did the same. In 2025 the middle had March to April at 200% of normal and August to September at 45%. Grids 15421 and 15422 had their driest year in 1956, at 37% of normal.</p>"}
